{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05NZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, \\mathcal{O}_X)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-definition-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{modules-definition-flat-at-point}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d6701600d542b484bd04ba17a7cb781bee3c086b82e718b088615f2108a7ee74", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:78214f6c81d466575b49b80592761a59b9bcff5e3c09e70cc27ff05b412bdf64", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nOn any ringed space <MATH_0001>\nwe know what it means for an <MATH_0002>-module\nto be flat (at a point), see\nModules, Definition <REF_0001>\n(Definition <REF_0002>).\nFor quasi-coherent sheaves on an affine scheme this matches the notion\ndefined in the algebra chapter.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b44d3f08ccf4e0cf2094a1be038bd1a4856f5766ed3c3cbcdd03ba7b61f5ab79", "unit_id": "tag:05NZ:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05NZ", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nFlatness is the same for modules and sheaves.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$X = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F} = \\widetilde{M}$", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$M$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0007": "$M$", "MATH_0008": "$R$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-flat-module}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8d706d5f712fa8a78e6aa1644b266bd695be962363cfdabf6a28dfff20718dcd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f49c954e0f38ad6d55046867731d7576d5710562247284a2d8771aac0233fa04", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be an affine scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> for some <MATH_0003>-module <MATH_0004>.\nThe quasi-coherent sheaf <MATH_0005> is a flat\n<MATH_0006>-module if and only if <MATH_0007> is a flat <MATH_0008>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d068d67b0e04e894e4393b1ca7a97f8f1fc3da7fc9bdb025df03d2231358b37a", "unit_id": "tag:05P0:statement"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05NZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}_x = M_{\\mathfrak p}$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathfrak p$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-lemma-flat-stalks-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-localization}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5ac085cd7da4de8b3ebc4eb1fb3ff047547760833048b2a09ffd39e1e38dbc46", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:40cd1fc9ec856eb77b3add2c9b5f6dcd277ff474c3f5348d74fdabec3bdd240f", "source_text": "Flatness of <MATH_0001> may be checked on the stalks, see\nModules, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nThe same is true in the case of modules over a ring, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nAnd since <MATH_0002> if <MATH_0003> corresponds\nto <MATH_0004> the lemma is true.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2e6160b1f95137b8bbb3783c3f384518ad8b7514b5cccf25973a49266edb1bbc", "unit_id": "tag:05P0:proof"}
